-- Producer obligations explicitly on input same representation. absolute applies
-- after total signed sum, not termwise. near good no scaled-density divisions.
def Psalm (S:StepData c f) (R:Rep G f) (t F:ℝ) := ∀ M:Fibre S R,∀ i,M.turn=Wing.gasKey i → ∀ V:Config G c,flags t V=∅ → |S.push R.beta M.cicada V| ≤ S.push R.beta R.eval V*(F*R.p.mass M.crest M.weight)
end YM.MSbar.Bulk
